# Implementation Plan - WhatsApp & Email Dual Auth System (Registration, Login & Profile Updates)

This plan outlines the architecture for integrating **WhatsApp Cloud API OTP Service**, enabling **Email OR WhatsApp Number Registration & Login**, and providing **Profile Update Options** for contact info with security verification and audit logging.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Meta WhatsApp Cloud API Service:** We will create an extensible `IWhatsAppService` / `WhatsAppService` configured via `appsettings.json` (Phone Number ID, Access Token, Template Name). In development mode, if API credentials are not provided, it falls back cleanly to console output + demo OTP response.
> - **At Least One Channel Required:** Registration allows Email only, WhatsApp only, or Both — but requires at least one verified contact method.
> - **Independent OTP Verification:** If registering or updating with **Both**, two distinct 6-digit OTPs are dispatched and both must be verified.
> - **Security Audit Log:** When updating Email or WhatsApp in Profile, the previous contact details are archived in `AuditLogs` for security, and an informational alert is sent to the old channel.

